       "    InvestigationOwnerOnlyCapsuleLease.make(\n"
       "        owner: owner, reader: reader, request: request,\n"
       "        system: system, borrower: nil\n"
       "    )\n"
       "}\n",
       "ii-c0b-ii-b one-shot lease cardinality drifted")
